    "description": "<p class=\"oi-description-part-one\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 100;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 100;\">COMING AGAIN IN MARCH!!</span></p>\n<p class=\"oi-description-part-one\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 100;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 100;\">PRELOVED is our reuse program in which our customers donate their gently used Simply Merino products they no longer need. We mend the garments if needed, and resell them to you!  All proceeds go to both repairing the item, and local charities.  Our goal is to extend the life of our products, offer lower prices, and save them from landfills. Sale also includes NEW product samples, &amp; defected products either from our manufacturer or wool.</span><span class=\"oi-collapse-content-button\">  Learn more... </span></p>\n<p class=\"oi-description-part-two\"><span style=\"font-weight: 100;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 100;\">Interested in donating to our PRELOVED program? More info coming soon. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 100;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 100;\"><img height=\"67\" width=\"62\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/9507/1534/files/heart_480x480.png?v=1573261283\" alt=\"\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/9507/1534/files/heart_480x480.png?v=1573261283\"></span></p>",
